      "entry_id": "BIOME:betternether:nether_mushroom_forest_edge",
      "title": "Nether Mushroom Forest Edge",
      "summary": {
        "text": "Nether Mushroom Forest Edge é um bioma do Nether registrado por BetterNether: New Dawn com o ID betternether:nether_mushroom_forest_edge. O título preserva exatamente o valor fornecido pelo asset pt-BR do provider.",
        "sources": [
          {"type": "RUNTIME", "ref": "betternether:biome/betternether:nether_mushroom_forest_edge"},
          {"type": "OFFICIAL_CODE", "ref": "https://github.com/Reijin2312/BetterNether-New-Dawn/blob/543127cab48b1ecb0017fee4222af25e0583e185/src/main/java/org/betterx/betternether/registry/NetherBiomes.java"},
          {"type": "OFFICIAL_CODE", "ref": "https://github.com/Reijin2312/BetterNether-New-Dawn/blob/543127cab48b1ecb0017fee4222af25e0583e185/src/main/resources/assets/betternether/lang/pt_br.json"}
        ]
      },
      "sections": {
        "worldgen": {
          "text": "O provider faz bootstrap deste ID com `NetherMushroomForestEdge`, e o registry o inclui em `registerBiomeToggles()`. `NetherMushroomForest.withEdgeBiome()` aponta para esta chave. Separadamente, o numeric provider e o selector de surface rules oficiais usam a grafia `nether_mushroom_forrest_edge`; a ficha preserva essa diferença de identificadores sem inventar números internos.",
          "sources": [
            {"type": "OFFICIAL_CODE", "ref": "https://github.com/Reijin2312/BetterNether-New-Dawn/blob/543127cab48b1ecb0017fee4222af25e0583e185/src/main/java/org/betterx/datagen/betternether/worldgen/NetherBiomesProvider.java"},
            {"type": "OFFICIAL_CODE", "ref": "https://github.com/Reijin2312/BetterNether-New-Dawn/blob/543127cab48b1ecb0017fee4222af25e0583e185/src/main/java/org/betterx/betternether/world/biomes/NetherMushroomForest.java"},
            {"type": "OFFICIAL_CODE", "ref": "https://github.com/Reijin2312/BetterNether-New-Dawn/blob/543127cab48b1ecb0017fee4222af25e0583e185/src/main/java/org/betterx/betternether/world/biomes/providers/NetherMushroomForestEdgeNumericProvider.java"},
            {"type": "DATAPACK", "ref": "betternether:wover/worldgen/surface_rules/nether_mushroom_forest_edge"}
          ]
        }
      },
      "references": [],
      "review_status": "REVIEWED",
      "availability": "RUNTIME"
    },
